// jpg_small_fixture with a real 1x1 MCU grid (jpg_st[5]/[6]=1) -- so
// grid.id's loop-walking cases run a real, complete MCU pass. jpg_c[2] (the
// one component's v-factor) is still 0, so jpg_cblks's own inner loop never
// runs -- the walk reaches every level safely without needing real blocks.
jpg_mcu_fixture() {
  jpg_small_fixture();
  jpg_mcu_set();
} return void;
